      "message": "In this CL, low complexity decode mode speed features of vertical 608p resolution are extended to vertical 720p resolution. We have tested this CL and its parent [CL](https://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/201361) on commit 96bfde38 (dated 2nd July). We validated that both patches don\u0027t conflict with the latest version.\n\nThe performance results of vertical 720p clips with low complexity decode mode enabled (excluding the impact of sf `adaptive_luma_loop_filter_skip`) are given below:\n```\n                        Instruction Count                                                                 \n                           Reduction(%)                        BD-Rate Loss(%)                  Time Reduction(%)\ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder    avg.psnr   ovr.psnr    ssim      vmaf    vmaf_neg    dav1d Decoder   \n   1         720p        2.766    24.886      1.3359     1.3611    1.9895    1.3155    1.1476       21.456\n   2         720p        5.609    22.952      1.3198     1.3847    1.9864    1.5441    1.2854       19.535\n   3         720p        4.171    23.540      1.5470     1.5760    2.2365    1.9067    1.5958       20.264\n```\nThe performance results of vertical 720p clips with low complexity decode enabled w.r.t lc-dec\u003d0 are given below. This comparison includes the impact of `adaptive_luma_loop_filter_skip` which was enabled by default for all resolutions.\n```\n                        Instruction Count                                                                 \n                           Reduction(%)                        BD-Rate Loss(%)                  Time Reduction(%)\ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder    avg.psnr   ovr.psnr    ssim      vmaf    vmaf_neg    dav1d Decoder   \n   1         720p        2.911    27.681      1.4562     1.5024    2.0682    1.3237    1.1405       24.172\n   2         720p        5.723    26.168      1.5016     1.5587    2.1789    1.5659    1.3019       22.888\n   3         720p        4.211    26.139      1.6772     1.7189    2.3573    1.9171    1.6132       22.805\n```",
